Dialogue: 5,0:00:18.65,0:00:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time I saw Sengoku Nadeko was more than six years ago.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.11,0:00:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So when we met again, I couldn't recognize her at first.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.99,0:00:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Had I noticed it was her a lot sooner,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.28,0:00:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps this story wouldn't have concluded in such a terrible manner.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:08.50,0:01:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But that regret
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.18,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,certainly has no meaning for the spirit either.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:04.95,0:03:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that girl...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:07.22,0:03:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd find a person this deep in the mountains.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.94,0:03:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And she was pretty damn cute.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:15.32,0:03:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just keep going.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.26,0:03:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, watch your feet.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:21.28,0:03:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Bug bites are unavoidable, but a lot of snakes come out in this mountain.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:25.47,0:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.99,0:03:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.75,0:03:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to ask you yesterday, but what are we doing on this mountain?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:40.32,0:03:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A job.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.67,0:03:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,From Oshino.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:45.98,0:03:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there's an abandoned shrine at the top of the mountain,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.66,0:03:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and he wants us to place a seal there.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.57,0:04:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't Oshino-san have done that himself?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.61,0:04:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look very busy.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.66,0:04:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... it's work.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.86,0:04:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe him a ridiculous amount of debt from when he took care of me.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:13.62,0:04:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You do, too, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:18.52,0:04:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He {\i1}is{\i0\fscx140} {\r}still a professional.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:21.51,0:04:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not nice enough to lend us a hand for free.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:25.90,0:04:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's why.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:31.62,0:04:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:33.27,0:04:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Senjougahara-senpai say anything about today?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:39.22,0:04:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in particular, no.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.84,0:04:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru, did she say something to you?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:44.80,0:04:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me to be spoiled as much as possible.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She also told me...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:55.81,0:05:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"If Araragi-kun violates you, report to me immediately.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:00.09,0:05:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it's to be buried in the mountains or drowned in the sea, I'll let him choose the one he doesn't like."
Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.57,0:05:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose the one I {\i1}don't{\i0\fscx150} {\r}like?!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.11,0:05:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:16.41,0:05:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered about Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.68,0:05:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her birthday soon, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:20.76,0:05:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.33,0:05:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,July 7th.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:22.96,0:05:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was thinking about celebrating her birthday,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.20,0:05:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and I want to make my first time celebrating it really spectacular,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.34,0:05:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,inviting all her friends for a nice birthday party, you know?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:34.33,0:05:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:35.13,0:05:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Senjougahara-senpai will want to spend the day alone with you.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:40.97,0:05:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think she's that type of a woman.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.40,0:05:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Araragi-senpai?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.40,0:06:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your... left hand.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it doing?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.96,0:06:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Oshino-san, it'll be better before I turn twenty.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.56,0:06:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great to hear.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:11.04,0:06:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to play basketball again once you're twenty.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:16.46,0:06:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:56.82,0:06:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.87,0:07:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a little tired...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.93,0:07:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tired?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.17,0:07:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do you want to rest somewhere?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.08,0:07:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can we sit...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:07.11,0:07:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, Araragi-senpai, how about we have lunch?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.94,0:07:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunch?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:11.93,0:07:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.97,0:07:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm sick, I usually feel better after filling up my stomach.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.19,0:07:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:22.58,0:07:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Kanbaru, could you look for an open spot where we can eat?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:27.69,0:07:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go place this seal in the meantime.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.75,0:07:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:32.59,0:07:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, but I'll have to ask you to finish the job, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:37.33,0:07:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. {\ja}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:49.89,0:07:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like I've seen her somewhere before.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:53.56,0:07:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:54.11,0:08:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I hardly get the chance to meet girls in junior high unless it's through my sisters...{\lit: my sisters would but not me}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:01.37,0:08:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisters?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.25,0:08:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this the main shrine?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:19.66,0:08:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There, all done.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:22.30,0:08:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:32.13,0:08:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru?!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:33.63,0:08:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:48.64,0:08:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:51.83,0:08:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:54.41,0:08:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you mean, "Oh, it's you?"
Dialogue: 5,0:08:57.49,0:08:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart just jumped.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:02.59,0:09:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look good.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:03.86,0:09:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're feeling really sick,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.80,0:09:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I think you can lay down at the porch of the shrine after I move some stuff around.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:12.52,0:09:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:14.52,0:09:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.61,0:09:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look... at that.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:41.32,0:09:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Was her name...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku Nadeko?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:01.72,0:10:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This, and I think this.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:06.99,0:10:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that book might not help you much.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.52,0:10:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to go to a public college, I think this book's more helpful.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:25.95,0:10:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:27.33,0:10:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I'm a little surprised that you asked me to find you some reference books for college.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:33.31,0:10:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:34.56,0:10:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd start thinking about my future.{\s0}
Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.34,0:10:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your future?{\or w/e the TS tl is}
Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.20,0:10:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara and I were talking about it sometime ago,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:44.79,0:10:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and I asked her about what school she was applying for, but...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.70,0:10:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}If I remember correctly, Senjougahara-san's been invited to attend the public college in town, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.98,0:10:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure know everything.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.98,0:10:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I know everything. I just know what I know. {\MUST STAY LIKE THIS RAWR}
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.90,0:11:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:02.03,0:11:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you're applying for the same school as Senjougahara-san?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:06.12,0:11:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell her about this.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:07.95,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to give her any false hope.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:14.60,0:11:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.00,0:11:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what do you need?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:18.01,0:11:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}You know how you told me at school that you went to an abandoned shrine yesterday?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.51,0:11:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question about that.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.24,0:11:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do after you found a snake in five parts?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.77,0:11:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, really.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:36.92,0:11:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru and I dug a grave for the snake.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.51,0:11:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we looked around after that, we found a mountain of dead snakes.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.58,0:11:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A mountain?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.41,0:11:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. A mountain of chopped up snakes.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:54.66,0:11:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we immediately descended the mountain,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.75,0:12:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and had lunch that Kanbaru packed{\or lit "made/packed/cooked} at a nearby park.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.65,0:12:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:02.80,0:12:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was really amazed at how good it tasted.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.46,0:12:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, her grandma helped her.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:10.03,0:12:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sounds like you had a tough time, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.81,0:12:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:15.00,0:12:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It felt like some ritual to see snakes being killed in that way, so it made me think.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.64,0:12:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially since it was near that rundown shrine.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:23.32,0:12:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hanekawa.{\"Now that I mention it"}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.11,0:12:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you already know there was a shrine there?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:28.20,0:12:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The Kitashira Snake Shrine, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.76,0:12:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.22,0:12:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:34.17,0:12:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they worshiped snakes.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:37.55,0:12:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about it either, so...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.19,0:12:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Butchered snakes at a shrine that worshiped them...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.59,0:12:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a ritual.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.58,0:12:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I should tell Oshino...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.01,0:12:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,about this.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.32,0:12:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Araragi-kun, when I said you had a tough time, I was talking about you and Kanbaru-san.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:58.83,0:13:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A{\alpha&HFF&\t(523,523,\alpha&H00&)}bout {\alpha&HFF&\t(1023,1023,\alpha&H00&)}you {\alpha&HFF&\t(1524,1524,\alpha&H00&)}and {\alpha&HFF&\t(2024,2024,\alpha&H00&)}Ka{\alpha&HFF&\t(2525,2525,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(3025,3025,\alpha&H00&)}ba{\alpha&HFF&\t(3526,3526,\alpha&H00&)}ru{\alpha&HFF&\t(4026,4026,\alpha&H00&)}-san.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:03.82,0:13:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I was referring to.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,About Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:18.84,0:13:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:20.55,0:13:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She suddenly fell ill, so I got kind of scared,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.52,0:13:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm glad it turned out to be nothing.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:26.55,0:13:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:28.82,0:13:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a problem to get too close with your girlfriend's junior?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.30,0:13:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It's not a problem to be a little friendly, but I don't think linking arms is acceptable.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a generally clingy person.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.54,0:13:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's an acceptable excuse?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:43.40,0:13:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:45.76,0:13:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.04,0:13:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I already received a warning from Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.30,0:13:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not tolerate any rudeness towards my junior.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:53.41,0:13:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Or something like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.41,0:13:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And she apparently told Kanbaru to ask me to take care of her.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.64,0:14:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:01.16,0:14:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Would this be what she means?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:06.27,0:14:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.15,0:14:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you need another second, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:29.06,0:14:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.13,0:14:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you're weak and pale.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:35.97,0:14:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how you're kind to just about anyone?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:38.94,0:14:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I think from Senjougahara-san's point of view, that isn't very reassuring.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:43.91,0:14:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't reassuring?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:45.02,0:14:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I don't think Senjougahara-san actually wants you to be very close with Kanbaru-san.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:53.34,0:14:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.43,0:14:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be close, or rather she wants you two to be close,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:58.18,0:15:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but she wants you to be firm about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:01.07,0:15:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she wants you to choose her in comparison to Kanbaru-san.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.49,0:15:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.18,0:15:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.49,0:15:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably Senjougahara-san's dilemma.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.53,0:15:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}You're her valuable boyfriend, and Kanbaru-san's an important junior to her.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:19.50,0:15:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... since Senjougahara-san's a tsundere,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:22.72,0:15:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's right to take her actions for what they are.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:27.57,0:15:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to read deep into them.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.65,0:15:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.15,0:15:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly find Senjougahara-san important,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:34.30,0:15:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should sway from an insignificant temptation.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.59,0:15:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's irresponsible to be nice to everyone.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.08,0:15:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know now, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:47.93,0:15:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, where are you applying, Hanekawa?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:50.76,0:15:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokyo University?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:52.04,0:15:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you going to study abroad?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:54.67,0:15:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.40,0:15:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to college.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:59.37,0:16:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're not?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:01.75,0:16:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:02.37,0:16:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going on a journey once I graduate.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:05.22,0:16:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A journey?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:07.00,0:16:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd spend two years or so seeing the world.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:10.61,0:16:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I seem to be too focused on pursuing knowledge,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.57,0:16:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured I should gain a lot of other experiences.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.23,0:16:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep this a secret from the teachers.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.82,0:16:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd probably jump if they found out.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.77,0:16:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt that's all they'd do.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.12,0:16:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.34,0:16:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.04,0:16:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just a little headache.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.39,0:16:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A headache?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:35.03,0:16:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.56,0:16:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It recently started to happen from time to time.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.70,0:16:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It starts hurting without a warning.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:40.19,0:16:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that doesn't sound like nothing.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.31,0:16:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to walk you home?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.18,0:16:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.58,0:16:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My home's...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:47.81,0:16:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.91,0:16:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:50.04,0:16:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.00,0:16:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.45,0:16:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:53.63,0:16:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. See ya.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:54.96,0:16:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:04.13,0:17:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:18.02,0:17:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This book's...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.74,0:17:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:28.10,0:17:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you for a little help.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.63,0:17:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So what did you need me for?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:42.82,0:17:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Do you remember the girl we met when we were going up these stairs yesterday?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:47.49,0:17:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.45,0:17:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a cute small girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.89,0:17:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I thought I had seen her somewhere, and it hit me when I just saw her at the bookstore.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.81,0:17:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my younger sister's old friend.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:58.77,0:17:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:59.90,0:18:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And is that girl here again?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:03.03,0:18:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:04.50,0:18:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.41,0:18:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I asked for your help because...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:07.61,0:18:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... though she's an old friend, I don't know how to approach her.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.70,0:18:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}She probably doesn't remember me, so it could look like I'm flirting with her,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.67,0:18:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and a girl who just started puberty can have pretty scary reactions.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.33,0:18:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that you have some experience.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:23.53,0:18:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't deny that.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.72,0:18:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}On the other hand, Kanbaru, you look like you know how to handle younger girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:30.21,0:18:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering that you're the number one star in school.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:32.43,0:18:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.60,0:18:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand what you're trying to say.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.15,0:18:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I am good at dealing with younger girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:39.42,0:18:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.91,0:18:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I asked you.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:42.57,0:18:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's your request, I'm not at all reluctant about helping you,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.85,0:18:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but this matter also has to do with what we saw yesterday, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.08,0:18:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.83,0:18:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So... that's how it is?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:58.03,0:18:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.96,0:19:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:15.92,0:19:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:17.81,0:19:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Sengoku!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:20.42,0:19:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:28.60,0:19:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.84,0:19:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Sengoku Nadeko, second grade, class one.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:32.58,0:19:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have very many friends.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.45,0:19:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But Rara-chan plays with me.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.36,0:19:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When Rara-chan invites me to play, my heart feels lifted.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.82,0:19:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, Rara-chan has a brother in sixth grade.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:48.42,0:19:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Koyomi, and...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.92,0:19:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come in.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.57,0:20:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You changed your room.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:03.61,0:20:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:04.68,0:20:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I got my own room now.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:06.16,0:20:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My sisters are still in their old room.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:09.53,0:20:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll probably be back in a while, so do you want to see them?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.98,0:20:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Araragi-senpai's room!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:19.06,0:20:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my first time in a guy's room.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.67,0:20:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, time to look for some porn magazines.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.13,0:20:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That... is an event that only occurs when a guy comes to play in another guy's room!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:30.17,0:20:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be quiet and sit right there!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.14,0:20:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}However, I believe knowing your taste won't be completely meaningless to me.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.89,0:20:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, it'll be more than problematic.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.27,0:20:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, so problematic materials...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:47.15,0:20:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the personification of a problematic material!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.14,0:20:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can sit right there or jump out the window!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.58,0:20:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No other choice, Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.67,0:21:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already uncovered your {\i1}taste{\i0\fscx150} {\r}when I stalked you in the past.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:00.74,0:21:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the title of every pornography magazine you bought in the recent past.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:06.29,0:21:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.46,0:21:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.92,0:21:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No one was in that store when I bought it!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.30,0:21:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure of that.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.42,0:21:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have quite the maniacal taste.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:20.18,0:21:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have one choice!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.90,0:21:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump out the window!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:23.51,0:21:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If you asked for such {\i1}play{\i0}, any ordinary girl would try to run away even if she has to jump out the window.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.92,0:21:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But not to worry.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:31.02,0:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hardly a challenge for a girl of my caliber.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.28,0:21:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's proud about it!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.97,0:21:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:47.51,0:21:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and Kanbaru-san,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:49.28,0:21:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,may I request that you turn around for a bit?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:57.30,0:21:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done now.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.87,0:22:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please turn around.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:10.04,0:22:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bloomers?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:11.42,0:22:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:13.72,0:22:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I lent her the bloomers that I {\i1}coincidentally{\i0\fscx150} {\r}had.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:17.31,0:22:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:18.53,0:22:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Junior Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:19.88,0:22:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You carry around bloomers by pure chance?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:23.59,0:22:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what any lady would do.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:26.30,0:22:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that would apply to perverts.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:29.27,0:22:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can understand that Sengoku doesn't want to show us her underwear,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.09,0:22:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but bloomers...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:36.51,0:22:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:41.97,0:22:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like rope marks from bondage play.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:45.46,0:22:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those... scales? From fish?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:49.34,0:22:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, in her case, it would be a reptile? Snakes?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.46,0:22:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:56.74,0:23:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're an adult, you won't feel lustful from seeing my body, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:04.87,0:23:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:06.47,0:23:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I won't.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:08.25,0:23:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.71,0:23:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:12.21,0:23:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I would think that stating you have absolutely no interest in a lady in the nude
Dialogue: 5,0:23:16.20,0:23:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,is in fact more of an insult to a girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:19.11,0:23:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:20.73,0:23:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll correct myself.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:21.93,0:23:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I do have some dirty thoughts from seeing your body.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:29.80,0:23:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.07,0:23:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I did as you said, and I made a junior high girl cry!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:34.86,0:23:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd tell her so directly.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:37.36,0:23:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:39.11,0:23:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 5,0:23:41.95,0:23:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like this body.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:45.03,0:23:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:47.50,0:23:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:49.09,0:23:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:25.90,0:25:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.46,0:25:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:27.23,0:25:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! No matter how you say it, nothing is going to change.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:29.21,0:25:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's going to change!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:30.57,0:25:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so the guy who thought my name was Karen like in "Junjou Karen" matters a lot!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:33.69,0:25:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, a lot!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:34.40,0:25:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,One spells my name "Karen" but it's not said Karen, it's Kallen!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:36.85,0:25:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Karen, it's Kallen!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:38.47,0:25:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not going to come back is he?
Dialogue: 5,0:25:39.89,0:25:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think, Tsukihi-chan?
Dialogue: 5,0:25:41.07,0:25:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say it's not walking, that's it.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:42.48,0:25:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, that's it!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:43.24,0:25:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is like the "kuda" in Matsuo Basho's name.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:46.83,0:25:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 5,0:25:47.45,0:25:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Atsukihi!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:48.23,0:25:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the Mogami River, you go to sea!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:49.72,0:25:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't dump me into the sea like that!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:51.23,0:25:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:52.24,0:25:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:53.03,0:25:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Modern theme quiz!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:54.04,0:25:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Modern theme?
Dialogue: 5,0:25:54.73,0:25:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the depression of the century!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:56.58,0:25:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's serious!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:57.40,0:25:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you'll hit the jackpot after 99 years!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:59.60,0:26:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What great luck!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:00.82,0:26:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, Nadeko Snake, part 2!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:02.66,0:26:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it could happen in less than a year.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:04.45,0:26:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Or it could also take longer than a hundred years.
